{
  "id": "mikrotik",
  "name": "MikroTik RouterOS",
  "description": "Roteadores MikroTik (RouterOS 6/7). Login sem cores/detecção de terminal e atalhos de /export e backup.",
  "default_port": 22,
  "pty": true,
  "sftp": "full",
  "username_suffix": "+ct",
  "init_commands": [],
  "quick_commands": [
    {"group": "Sistema", "label": "Recursos (CPU/RAM/versão)", "command": "/system resource print"},
    {"group": "Sistema", "label": "Identidade", "command": "/system identity print"},
    {"group": "Sistema", "label": "Routerboard / firmware", "command": "/system routerboard print"},
    {"group": "Sistema", "label": "Verificar atualização", "command": "/system package update check-for-updates"},
    {"group": "Rede", "label": "Interfaces", "command": "/interface print"},
    {"group": "Rede", "label": "Endereços IP", "command": "/ip address print"},
    {"group": "Rede", "label": "Rotas", "command": "/ip route print"},
    {"group": "Rede", "label": "Leases DHCP", "command": "/ip dhcp-server lease print"},
    {"group": "Rede", "label": "Vizinhos (MNDP/LLDP)", "command": "/ip neighbor print"},
    {"group": "Firewall", "label": "Regras de filtro", "command": "/ip firewall filter print"},
    {"group": "Firewall", "label": "Regras de NAT", "command": "/ip firewall nat print"},
    {"group": "Firewall", "label": "Conexões (primeiras)", "command": "/ip firewall connection print count-only"},
    {"group": "Segurança", "label": "Usuários", "command": "/user print"},
    {"group": "Segurança", "label": "Configuração do SSH e fingerprint", "command": "/ip ssh print"},
    {"group": "Logs", "label": "Log", "command": "/log print"},
    {"group": "Backup", "label": "Exportar configuração (compact)", "command": "/export compact"},
    {"group": "Backup", "label": "Exportar para arquivo", "command": "/export compact file={{nome}}"},
    {"group": "Backup", "label": "Backup binário", "command": "/system backup save name={{nome}}"}
  ],
  "notes": [
    "O TT acrescenta +ct ao usuário (desliga cores e detecção de terminal do RouterOS) quando o login ainda não tem sufixo.",
    "Confira a fingerprint do host com `/ip ssh print` na primeira conexão; ela muda se o roteador regenerar a chave.",
    "Com chave pública cadastrada para o usuário, o RouterOS recusa senha por padrão (password-authentication=yes-if-no-key)."
  ]
}
